\rtlch\fcs1 \af31507 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid10772110 This report presents findings from a small study undertaken by the Office for Disability Issues (ODI) and 
the Department for Culture, Media and Sport (DCMS). The aim was to collect information about the service disabled spectators receive when they attend a sporting event and issues around accessibility to ensure that their rights are properly recognised in t
his area.
\par This introductory section sets out the background and policy context to this study (Section 1.1) and then outlines the aims (Section 1.2). Section 1.3 discusses the project design and methodology and Section 1.4 outlines the structure of the report.

\par }\pard\plain \ltrpar\s2\ql \li0\ri0\sb200\sl276\slmult1\keep\keepn\widctlpar\wrapdefault\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\outlinelevel1\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid10772110 \rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af31503\afs26\alang1025 \ltrch\fcs0 
